			<div class="content" id="post-content-1923677">
									

<p>I'm not sure if I buy this as an SCP. It's events related to anomalies, but nothing here has any indication of anomalous stuff. Not even the CI agent says she's actually anomalous. The Foundation is allowed to lock up stuff other than anomalies.</p>
<p>That's not all the article's flaws, though. The last note, as has been said, is silly and detracts. If the girl is something special, the CI are idiots for trying to snatch her in the middle of a Foundation site. If she's not anything special, then it reads like SCP-884, except instead of the CI crippling thousands of Foundation personnel, they highly inconvenience one. This doesn't really make sense, either way.</p>

